                <head rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">expression of sympathy for the american
                    union</hi>.</head>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“On motion of Mr. Lang Hussy, at a meeting of many citizens of Oftringen,
                        just after the state elections, it was unanimously resolved to approve of
                        the Swiss address of sympathy and condolence to the American Union.”</p>
                </quote>
